" EPITA exam vimrc - the memorizable delta over Vim's built-in defaults.vim
" (defaults.vim already gives: syntax, filetype indent, incsearch, wildmenu,
"  ruler, backspace, mouse)
" Type this from memory at exam start:  vim ~/.vimrc

set nu et sw=4 sts=4 cc=80
set ai cin hls ic scs
set cb=unnamedplus
